---
const tiers = [
  { name: 'Monitor', price: '$499', per: 'per month', pitch: 'Keeps you watching', mid: false, lines: ['Monthly positions on your question queries', 'Competitor naming tracked over time', 'Do-it-yourself recommendations'] },
  { name: 'Move', price: '$1,299', per: 'per month', pitch: 'Keeps you in the game', mid: true, lines: ['Everything in Monitor', 'Ongoing query and competitor research', 'One published article per month'] },
  { name: 'Max', price: '$2,499', per: 'per month', pitch: 'Fights for the top spot', mid: false, lines: ['Everything in Move', 'Four published articles per month', 'Deeper research across more query types', 'Two hours of schema work as your services change'] },
];
---
<section id="pricing" class="psec">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow blk">Pricing</div>
    <h2 class="sec">Published, because you should not have to ask.</h2>
    <p class="lead mut">The build comes first. It is the work that makes you findable and quotable in the first place. Ongoing plans are only sold after the build is done, because there is nothing to maintain until then.</p>

    <div class="build-card">
      <div>
        <h3>The Foundation Build</h3>
        <p>Full schema and JSON-LD implementation, SEO and GEO cleanup across your site, service and service-area pages written so a machine can quote them, baseline directory presence, and a review request system installed in your booking or POS flow. One time.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="build-price">
        <span class="grad-text">$5,000</span>
        <small>Starting &middot; larger sites quoted by page count</small>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="tiers">
      {tiers.map((t) => (
        <div class:list={['tier', { mid: t.mid }]}>
          <h3>{t.name}</h3>
          <div class="tier-price">{t.price}</div>
          <div class="tier-per">{t.per}</div>
          <div class="tier-pitch">{t.pitch}</div>
          {t.lines.map((l) => <div class="tier-line">{l}</div>)}
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
    <div class="terms">Six month agreements. Twelve months paid up front for the price of ten.<br />Additional work beyond plan hours is billed at $199 per hour.</div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .build-card { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr; gap: 32px; align-items: center; background: var(--bg-2); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 16px; padding: 32px; margin: 10px 0 16px; }
  .build-card h3 { font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 28px; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .build-card p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 15px; margin: 0; }
  .build-price { text-align: right; }
  .build-price span { font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 56px; line-height: 1; }
  .build-price small { display: block; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted-2); margin-top: 8px; }
  .tiers { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 16px; }
  .tier { display: flex; flex-direction: column; background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px 24px; }
  .tier.mid { border: 1px solid transparent; background: linear-gradient(var(--card), var(--card)) padding-box, var(--grad) border-box; }
  .tier h3 { font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 24px; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .tier-price { font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 38px; line-height: 1; color: #fff; margin: 10px 0 4px; }
  .tier-per { font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted-2); margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .tier-pitch { font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--gold); margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .tier-line { font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.45; padding: 9px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .terms { font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.03em; color: var(--muted-2); margin-top: 22px; line-height: 1.7; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .build-card, .tiers { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .build-price { text-align: left; }
  }
</style>
